{
  "title": "Colors, describing things, and agreement",
  "note": "Adjectives usually follow the noun and agree in gender and number: o carro novo, a casa nova, os carros novos. Most adjectives ending in -e or a consonant (grande, azul) do not change for gender. Bom (good) describes nouns; bem (well) describes actions.",
  "src": {"t": "Língua da Gente, Beginning 21: Is This A Good Color?", "u": "https://linguadagente.coerll.utexas.edu/beginning-is-this-a-good-color/"},
